%% @studio-id tgznntn1f5ez2kqr
flowchart LR
  accTitle: Feedback operations
  accDescr: A wide feedback operation from intake through triage, research, design, build, release, and follow-up. The page starts fitted, so zoom in to read one stage.

  subgraph capture [Capture]
    direction TB
    portal[Product portal] --> form[Feedback form]
    email[Support email] --> shared[Shared inbox]
    interview[Research interview] --> notes[Session notes]
    sales[Sales call] --> crm[CRM note]
    form --> intake[Intake queue]
    shared --> intake
    notes --> intake
    crm --> intake
    intake --> spam{Spam or noise?}
    spam -->|Drop| discarded[Discard]
    spam -->|Keep| tagged[Tag product area]
  end

  tagged --> dedupe{Already tracked?}
  dedupe -->|Yes| merge[Merge into the open item]
  dedupe -->|No| kind{What kind of feedback?}

  subgraph triage [Triage]
    direction TB
    kind -->|Bug| repro[Write reproduction steps]
    kind -->|Usability| cluster[Cluster related reports]
    kind -->|Request| demand[Score demand and segment]
    kind -->|Praise| praise[Record the praise signal]
    merge --> kind
    repro --> blocking{Blocks a key task?}
    blocking -->|Yes| incident[Open an incident]
    blocking -->|No| bugs[Bug backlog]
    incident --> hotfix{Needs a hotfix?}
    hotfix -->|Yes| patch[Prepare a patch]
    hotfix -->|No| bugs
    cluster --> evidence{Enough evidence?}
    evidence -->|No| followup[Schedule a follow-up]
    followup --> interview
    evidence -->|Yes| opportunity[Name the opportunity]
    demand --> roadmap{Already on the roadmap?}
    roadmap -->|No| parking[Parking lot]
    roadmap -->|Yes| opportunity
    parking --> quarterly[Quarterly review]
    quarterly --> roadmap
    praise --> signal[Add to the signal log]
  end

  subgraph shape [Shape the work]
    direction TB
    opportunity --> frame[Frame the problem]
    frame --> constraints[List constraints]
    constraints --> explore[Sketch approaches]
    explore --> critique{Ready for critique?}
    critique -->|Revise| explore
    critique -->|Proceed| spec[Write the spec]
    spec --> reviewSpec{Spec accepted?}
    reviewSpec -->|Changes| spec
    reviewSpec -->|Accepted| estimate[Estimate the work]
    estimate --> capacity{Room this cycle?}
    capacity -->|Later| scheduled[Schedule a later cycle]
    scheduled --> capacity
  end

  subgraph build [Build and release]
    direction TB
    capacity -->|Now| implement[Implement]
    implement --> designReview[Design review]
    designReview --> changes{Needs changes?}
    changes -->|Yes| implement
    changes -->|No| qa[Check against the original report]
    qa --> match{Matches the need?}
    match -->|No| implement
    match -->|Yes| ship[Ship]
    patch --> ship
    ship --> notes2[Write release notes]
    notes2 --> notify[Notify the reporter]
    notify --> support[Update support macros]
  end

  subgraph learn [Learn]
    direction TB
    support --> watch[Watch the metric]
    watch --> window[Wait for the review window]
    window --> outcome{Did it help?}
    outcome -->|No| opportunity
    outcome -->|Partial| refine[Open a refinement]
    refine --> opportunity
    outcome -->|Yes| resolved[Mark resolved]
    signal --> resolved
    resolved --> retro[Add to the retro]
    retro --> library[Update the pattern library]
    discarded --> retro
  end
